                  "text": "Current X-Ray project ID: job-6c9b0ad9-5813-40e5-90bd-64355a2446e4\nOne final arithmetic check: your list names 0, 3600, 6800 and 8000 mm (four datums), calls them three levels, and totals approximately 92. With THREE created levels, the listed 38 walls + 8 slabs + 44 openings + 2 roofs + 3 level operations = 95; four levels would be 96. On this fresh project an existing base level can be reused, which changes the number of level-creation operations. Please correct this precisely and acknowledge that exact fit/host placement is still untested. A single batch is not a requirement; progressive build-inspect-correct stages may be more reliable. In at most 180 words, give your final position and distinguish an ambitious proposed test from proven capability. Do not create anything."
